<!--Post: 8014--><!--Time: 1108794918-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8014"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:nugzter@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 18, 2005 - 10:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->These are some notes I took on the show. Some may be strange but please bare with me. <BR> <BR>Charlie O. said Mom was beaten so bad he didnt recognize her. &#40;I&#39;ve Never heard this before.&#41; <BR>Dads tounge bitten half off. &#40;I have read this I THINK&#41; <BR>He said he went and grabbed a knife to get revenge, but then decided to get siblings out of the house. The siblings were in the house a long time before Charlie arrived. <BR>And he looked very pissed. &#40;who wouldnt be&#41; <BR> <BR>Mr. Vian <BR>Rope tied to one door knob. Bed against the other one. <BR>Looked over door saw mom stipped and tied, bag on head. Stood on something to see, he dont remember what. <BR>Was asked if his &#34;PARENTS&#34; were home by BTK. &#40;why &#34;PARENTS&#34;?&#41; <BR> <BR>Ok, I saw the black jacket guy in another interview 25 mins into the show, and once again he said HomA-cide. &#40;Larry King also pronounced HomA-cide. Was this on purpose?&#41; <BR>This is the second interview I&#39;ve seen with him in it.  Also noticed what I think is the same guy carying a large case and a camera entering the house. Not sure what crime scene it was. <BR> <BR>Whats up with the red Mustang in the field and the gun shop images? <BR> <BR>OK, something strange... <BR>KING: Larry, do you think -- Pat mentioned it earlier -- that the media is being used? Do you think you&#39;re being used?  <BR> <BR>HATTEBERG: No, I don&#39;t think we&#39;re being used at all. I think we&#39;re covering probably the biggest story of our careers right now. But I don&#39;t think we&#39;re being used. <BR> <BR>upon answering this question he looked down and to the left, he is hiding something. My opinion. <BR> <BR>Larry asked everyone else on panel if they think they are being used by BTK and all responded yes, even Susan. <BR>Now Hatteberg keeps making a this one point. Ive seen atleast 3 recent vids with Hatteberg and he keeps saying there has never been a serial killer whos done this &#40;disappear for so long and return&#41; before. Like he is bragging.  <BR>I dont believe Hatteberg is BTK, but I do believe there are some sort of alternative motives. Not sure what. <BR>Ok thats what I got that I havnt already read or seen. Any further insight? <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8014-->
<!--Post: 8024--><!--Time: 1108822029-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8024"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 6:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think, just from watching Hatteburg over the last 15 years, that is just his style. He has a tendancy to be a little over dramatic at times. My husband and I have both commented on this in the past, prior to all of this going on now. I do not know him personally but I think this is just his way. He&#39;s been around for a long time and is a true journalist at heart, not just a talking head. This whole thing is really surreal, like a bad movie. As a journalist, it&#39;s got to be fascinating. All of us wish, of course, that this never happened but it has and I really think he&#39;s just expressing truthfully what we have all felt. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8024-->
<!--Post: 8027--><!--Time: 1108823054-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8027"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 6:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Anyone know what Hatteburg has been doing the past fifteen years. I have an idea about the disappearing act that he was talking about here&#39;s what I know think happened, sorry if this doesn&#39;t go here, but it goes along with the disappearing act. What if in 1974 BTK was the one dating Sherry Baker, because they say her BF was never found. anyone with that kind of heat, he just laid low for awhile because LE could have definitely linked him to her.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8027-->
<!--Post: 8038--><!--Time: 1108824569-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8038"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 6:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Embersage, the past fifteen reference in my post has to do with the length of time I&#39;ve lived here and been watching him broadcast the news. That&#39;s all.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8038-->
<!--Post: 8047--><!--Time: 1108836427-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8047"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Screamer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Screamer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 10:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here is a link to the transcripts for Larry King. <BR> <BR><a href="http://transcripts.cnn.com/TRANSCRIPTS/lkl.html" target=_top>http://transcripts.cnn.com/TRANSCRIPTS/lkl.html</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8047-->
<!--Post: 8049--><!--Time: 1108841127-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8049"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Featherw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Featherw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 11:25 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Embersage...I think that is a good thought.  It is worth considering. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8049-->
<!--Post: 8051--><!--Time: 1108842396-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8051"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 11:46 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Sorry I should have elaborated, Hatteberg said in the interview, &#34;To him we say, the message had been recieved and passed on. If he has been involved in this thing since 1974 and doing research for all these years, I believe he has been in communication with him.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
